      "confidence": 0.7817183136940002,
      "reading_order": 14,
      "text": "9. GMM of X is $2 \\times 13 - 26$.\nSince X is unsaturated hydrocarbon, it is either\nalkene or alkyne.\nIf X is alkene $\\mathrm{C}_n\\mathrm{H}_{2n}$, $n = 2, 3, 4...$\nGMM = $12n + 2n = 26$\n$\\Rightarrow 14n = 26$\n$\\Rightarrow n = \\frac{26}{14}, \\text{n}$ could have only whole number\n$\\Rightarrow x$ is alkyne $\\mathrm{C}_n\\mathrm{H}_{2n-2}$; $n = 2, 3, ...$\nGMM = $12n + 2n - 2 = 26$\n$\\Rightarrow 14n = 28$"
